  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> Whenever you use an effect which transfers damage from another creature to yourself, you gain one temporary hit point for every point of Accrual you possess. If at least one spell point is spent on the effect, you may instead heal 1 hit point for every point of Accrual you possess.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/accrual#toc13\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
